`project.yaml` is not part of it. Editing a whole-file part marks every finished audit
`context-changed`; editing a term resets only the batches that mention it. Stale runs are
reported with one of: {% for reason in stale_reasons %}`{{ reason }}`{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}. A
`context-changed` run also names the part that changed and its line count before and after
(`context_changes`), so the cost of growing a context file is visible where it is paid.

