## Record and repository

The generated project `.gitignore` keeps out the source PDF, `output/`, the layout cache,
per-asset `original.pdf` files and unreferenced source review packets, and keeps
`.littrans/work/` (the packet payloads the audit ledger names) in while ignoring the lock:

```text
{% for line in ignore_lines %}
{{ line }}
{% endfor %}
```

`project tracked PROJECT` derives the record from the data (assets, receipts, batches,
ledgers) and asks git whether exactly that set is tracked; it fails on any gap. Source
review packets named by page receipts are live dependencies and must be re-included by name.

## Launcher

`tools/lt.py` resolves the plugin by `LITTRANS_PLUGIN_ROOT`, then the recorded plugin root,
then the highest-versioned sibling of it; `tools/lt.cmd` and `tools/lt.sh` pick the
interpreter (3.12+ for the CLI, 3.10–3.13 as the layout detector's base).
